OL,3,GNEWSACCTV plan for medieval castle hit
OL,4,Aby arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA medieval castle in Cheshire is set
OL,7,Fhave CCTV installed after it was
OL,8,Fdamaged by vandals.
OL,10,FHalton Castle in Runcorn, which dates
OL,11,Fback to 1071, has been plagued by arson
OL,12,Fattacks and damage to its walls, a
OL,13,Freport to Halton's local economy policy
OL,14,Fand performance board on the upkeep of
OL,15,Fthe landmark has revealed.
OL,17,FHalton Council is now looking to
OL,18,Finstall a CCTV camera after securing
OL,19,Ffunding for conservation and security.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
